[TITLE]
Lua script that reports the project's flow and pressure units

[JUNCTIONS]
 J1  100
 J2   90

[RESERVOIRS]
 R1  200

[PIPES]
 P1  R1  J1  1000  300  100  0  Open
 P2  J1  J2  1000  300  100  0  Open

[SCRIPT]
function on_open()
  print("flow=" .. units().flow, "pressure=" .. units().pressure)
end

[COORDINATES]
 J1  0  0
 J2  1  0
 R1  0  1

[OPTIONS]
 Units     CMH
 Pressure  kPa

[END]
